gatH(){return"How do I edit my personal details and save changes?"},
garo(){return"Open your avatar at the top right and choose Personal details, or go to Settings \u2192 Personal details. Available details appear immediately; when a refresh is needed, it runs without blocking the form and keeps what you are typing. Use Refresh personal details for a manual check. Edit your name or avatar and press Save changes: the button is enabled only when something has changed. If you go back without saving, choose Discard or Continue. To update your sign-in address, press Change email under SIGN-IN EMAIL."},
gatP(){return"Can an unused account be deleted automatically?"},
gary(){return"Confirmed accounts are checked periodically: after more than 12 months since recorded app activity it may start the inactivity process. When activity history is unavailable and the account does not own projects, the last sign-in is used instead. These accounts are also checked periodically. You receive an initial warning allowing at least 30 days and a final reminder allowing at least another 7 days; deletion requires delivery confirmation for both emails. To stop the process, sign in and load the calendar before the deadline. Opening the email alone does not record activity. If you own projects, the succession process described in the dedicated FAQ applies."},
gatD(){return"Where can I delete my account?"},
garj(){return"Open Settings \u2192 Personal details and scroll to ACCOUNT MANAGEMENT. Press Delete account, read the warning and type your account email to enable confirmation. Deletion is permanent; you can cancel before confirming."},
