gat3(){return"On the web, when subscriptions are available, open Settings \u2192 Account \u2192 My subscriptions. Choose Monthly or Yearly: the plan price and currency configured in Stripe are displayed. The annual option also shows a monthly equivalent, but is charged annually. Press Continue to payment and check the final summary, including any taxes or discounts. Test mode is clearly marked and only uses test cards."},
gat2(){return"Active indicates an active plan; Trial indicates a trial period. Ending indicates that automatic renewal is turned off. For Payment due, use Update payment; when payment verification is pending, wait and press Refresh status without starting another purchase. Manage subscription opens the Stripe portal. If a price is unavailable, refresh the status. An open checkout can only be resumed for the same billing period until it expires."},
