gauP(){return"Participation in live events and rehearsals"},
gau7(){return"How do I say I will not attend a live event or rehearsal?"},
gas7(){return"Open the project of the band that created the appointment, select the day and tap the live event or rehearsal. In the details, under Your participation, choose Opt out. You are not participating will also appear in the list. If your plans change, reopen the details and choose Rejoin."},
gau9(){return"Can I choose even if I did not create the event?"},
gasc(){return"Yes. Each member can change their own participation in live events and rehearsals they can see in the project. This includes Limited members with access to the event. You cannot change someone else\u2019s choice."},
gau6(){return"If I opt out, does the event disappear or am I shown as free?"},
gas5(){return"The event stays in the calendar of the band that created it. In Personal mode, it no longer marks you as busy for that appointment: its list row shows You are not participating. In Band mode, it keeps its color because the band\u2019s appointment still exists."},
gas6(){return"For example, you play in two bands and opt out of the first band\u2019s live event. In the second band\u2019s project, you will no longer be busy because of that event. Other commitments on the same day still count: opting out does not clear the whole day. Choose Rejoin to restore the commitment."},
gau5(){return"What does the small person icon in the calendar mean?"},
gas3(){return"It means you are not participating in at least one appointment of the band you are viewing on that day. The icon is at the bottom left: a soft green background means a live event and a soft blue background means a rehearsal."},
gaua(){return"Do events I have declined appear in search?"},
gase(){return"Yes. You can still find the event by searching the project of the band that created it, if you have permission to see it. Results show You are not participating. Details show Your participation separately from Confirmed or To be confirmed. Other projects no longer show the copy that marked you as busy for that event."},
gau8(){return"Does opting out change the event for other members?"},
gas9(){return"Your choice does not change the event, its confirmation or who can see it. You can therefore opt out even if the live event is already confirmed."},
gasa(){return"Choosing Opt out or Rejoin does not send other members a notification of your choice. It does not turn off notifications for you either: you may still receive event updates and project reminders according to the current rules and your preferences."},
gasw(){return"The owner manages groups in project settings. Tap the name in the Selected group panel to open the group list, with member counts and the default group indicator. The panel shows the active group\u2019s members and the button for adding more. Choose New group to create one, or use the menu beside its name to rename it or make it the default. Choose Save changes to apply your edits."},
garD(){return"Use \xd7 to remove an address you have just entered; empty fields are ignored. You cannot invite yourself or add the same email twice to a group, even with different capitalization or spaces. If an address is incomplete, the app takes you to the field that needs correcting."},
gas2(){return"To hand ownership to someone else, choose Transfer ownership in the menu of a member with a confirmed account. Assigning the Admin role does not transfer ownership."},
