gaAb(){return"What should I check?"},
gaAc(){return"Check that the reminder is active and that you are among its recipients. Limited members must be included using the project option. To receive the alert, notifications must also be enabled on this device."},
gaA0(){return"How alerts are delivered"},
gaA_(){return"With the app open, a message may appear in a popup. When the app is not open, a device notification may arrive. Network, browser and device conditions can delay delivery."},
gas0(){return"The Notifications row in Settings shows the status and opens a dedicated screen. Under On this device, use Receive notifications; the top panel explains whether permission or a retry is needed. Activation not confirmed does not mean alerts are working: press Retry. If deactivation is incomplete, use Retry to finish it. Reminders are still configured within each project."},
