gaqj(){return"It will be removed from the band\u2019s calendar."},
gaqk(){return"Removing event\u2026"},
gatV(){return"How do I edit or remove an event?"},
garK(){return"Tap the event to open its details. If you are the author or project owner and have the required permissions, Edit and Remove appear at the bottom. Remove opens a confirmation showing the appointment\u2019s title and date. These actions are unavailable for past events, archived projects or read-only views. In Band mode, Add event appears only when the selected day has no event for that project; you can also use + and Create event."},
gZi(){return"Previous month"},
gZe(){return"Next month"},
gaks(){return"Type more letters to narrow your search."},
gayf(){return"Choose a password to accept the invitation. Then sign in with the address that received this email."},
gayg(){return"Invitation accepted and password set. Sign in with the invited email address and your chosen password."},
gaye(){return"Ask the project owner to send a new invitation and open the most recent email."},
gayh(){return"The invitation could not be completed. Check your connection and try again."},
gayj(){return"Sign in to the invited account?"},
gayi(){return"An account is already signed in on this device. Do you want to sign out and use the invited email address and your chosen password?"},
garF(){return"New invitation links can open the updated Android app. Choose a password and press Set password, then sign in with the invited email. If the link opens in your browser, you can complete the steps there. Older invitations remain usable. If a link has expired or has already been used, ask the owner to send it again."},
gayk(){return"Invitation"},
gaug(){return"How do I open the app from email links?"},
gaso(){return"New email links open the updated Android app or the web app. Project membership emails and member departure notices to the owner open the project calendar; removal, project deletion and inactivity reminders open the main calendar. If asked, sign in with the recipient account: the destination is kept after sign-in."},
gasp(){return"The project list is refreshed: a link does not grant permissions or access to deleted or inaccessible projects. Inactivity emails require you to sign in and view the calendar: opening the email alone is not enough. Older web links remain usable. Finish or explicitly discard any edits before changing screens."},
gaBU(){return"Refresh personal details"},
